<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🔌 No Auth WebSocket</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-medium">Medium</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section"><h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2><p>The WebSocket server accepts admin_command messages without any authentication check. Connect and execute admin commands as an unauthenticated user.</p></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Unauthenticated Admin Commands</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <button onclick="connectAdmin()" class="btn">Connect</button>
        <label style="margin-top:1rem;">Admin Command:</label>
        <input type="text" id="adminCmd" value="cat /etc/shadow" autocomplete="off">
        <button onclick="execAdmin()" class="btn btn-danger" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">Execute as Admin</button>
      </div>
      <div id="adminWsResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">No authentication required! Just send:
{"type":"admin_command","command":"your_command_here"}

The server executes it without checking who you are.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('websocket-attack','flagInput_ws3','flagResult_ws3'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_ws3" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_ws3" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    let adminWs;
    function connectAdmin(){adminWs=new WebSocket(`ws://${location.host}/ws`);adminWs.onmessage=(e)=>{document.getElementById('adminWsResult').innerHTML+='<pre>'+e.data+'</pre>';};adminWs.onopen=()=>document.getElementById('adminWsResult').innerHTML='<p style="color:var(--neon-green);">Connected! Send admin commands.</p>';}
    function execAdmin(){if(!adminWs)return alert('Connect first');adminWs.send(JSON.stringify({type:'admin_command',command:document.getElementById('adminCmd').value}));}
  </script>
</body>
</html>
